{%- comment -%}
  Montibello PDP — routine.

  Matches the reference PDPs' "Descubre la rutina completa" module: numbered
  steps, where one step number can hold more than one product side by side
  (e.g. Ultra Repair's step 2 groups Mask + Rinse together). `montibello.routine`
  is a list of `montibello_routine_step` metaobject references, ONE metaobject
  per numbered step (step_number, label, products — `products` is itself a
  list, so step 2 holds both Mask and Rinse on a single metaobject rather than
  needing two step-2 records grouped at render time). Fields are accessed
  with direct dot notation (`step.step_number.value`), not
  `step.fields.step_number.value`.

  The manager's metaobject list defines ROUTINE STEP but not a separate
  higher-level "routine" record, so the product-level `routine` metafield is
  implemented directly as this ordered step list rather than inventing an
  unlisted metaobject type — see docs/product-pages/product-data-schema.md.

  MANAGER FEEDBACK CLOSURE PASS — two fixes, both confirmed against the live
  official Ultra Repair Shampoo page before changing anything:

  1. CAROUSEL: rebuilt from a wrapping/static flex row into a real
     horizontal scroller — one flat list of CARDS (one per product, not per
     step), each carrying its own step-number badge (shared across grouped
     products, e.g. both Mask and Rinse show "2"), CSS scroll-snap, and
     desktop prev/next arrows that scroll by one card width. Flattening to
     one card per product (rather than nesting the grouped-step markup
     inside a scroll item) is what makes Mask and Rinse behave as two
     separate, independently snappable/scrollable cards, matching the
     official carousel's actual behavior.

  2. LABEL BUG (root-caused, not CSS-patched): the previous markup put the
     STEP's shared label (`step.label.value`, e.g. "Trata en la ducha") under
     EVERY product in that step, so Mask and Rinse both displayed the
     identical caption with no product-distinguishing text — reading as a
     duplicate card even though the underlying data was correct (confirmed
     live via the Admin API: the routine metafield has exactly 3 step
     entries, no duplicate references). This was never a data or
     duplicate-reference bug — it was a presentation bug. Fixed by rendering
     the step label ONCE per step group (as a shared caption under the
     group, shown only when that step has more than one product) and each
     product's OWN title under its own image.

  KNOWN REMAINING GAP (found during this pass, not fixed — flagged rather
  than silently patched or silently left unmentioned): the live official
  page actually has 4 steps, not 3 — "3 Trata durante la noche · ultra
  repair overnight serum" sits between Peru's current step 2 and step 3.
  Overnight Serum has no real Peru Shopify product (deliberately, per
  earlier approved scope — it's editorial-only on the HOP Ultra Repair
  range page's results panel), so adding it here would require either
  fabricating a product (forbidden) or extending this metaobject's schema
  to support a non-product editorial step. Left undone pending that
  decision — see final report.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% liquid
  assign steps = product.metafields.montibello.routine.value
  assign has_steps = false
  for step in steps
    assign has_steps = true
    break
  endfor

  # HOP ULTRA REPAIR — TRUE OFFICIAL PARITY FINAL: official heading reads
  # "Descubre la rutina completa Ultra Repair." (the SUBFAMILY name) on all
  # 4 PDPs, not "...HOP Ultra Repair Shampoo." (confirmed live) — the
  # previous unconditional `{{ product.title }}` suffix below produced that
  # exact bug. Scoped to the 4 real Ultra Repair products only so every
  # other range keeps its previous (already-approved) product.title suffix
  # unchanged.
  assign range = product.metafields.montibello.range.value
  assign subfamily = product.metafields.montibello.subfamily.value
  assign is_hop_ultra_repair = false
  if range == 'HOP' and subfamily == 'Ultra Repair' or range == 'HOP' and subfamily == 'Color Last' or range == 'HOP' and subfamily == 'Smooth Hydration'
    assign is_hop_ultra_repair = true
  endif
  assign routine_heading_suffix = product.title
  if is_hop_ultra_repair and subfamily != blank
    assign routine_heading_suffix = subfamily | replace: 'Color Last', 'Colour Last'
  endif
%}

{% if has_steps %}
  <div
    class="section section--{{ section.settings.section_width }} montibello-pdp-routine{% if is_hop_ultra_repair %} montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair{% endif %} spacing-style"
    style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}"
  >
    {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="montibello-pdp-routine__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }} {{ routine_heading_suffix }}.</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="montibello-pdp-routine__viewport">
      <button
        type="button"
        class="montibello-pdp-routine__arrow montibello-pdp-routine__arrow--prev"
        data-montibello-routine-prev
        aria-label="Paso anterior"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </button>

      <ol class="montibello-pdp-routine__list" data-montibello-routine-track>
        {% if is_hop_ultra_repair %}
          {% comment %}
            HOP ULTRA REPAIR: the official component is GROUP-based — one slide
            per STEP (number + label once, then every product of that step
            side by side), vertical rule between groups, canvas images from the
            same official files as the gallery (first `official_gallery` entry
            of each product), eyebrow + title under each canvas.
          {% endcomment %}
          {% for step in steps %}
            {% assign step_products = step.products.value %}
            <li class="montibello-pdp-routine__group">
              <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__group-number">{{ step.step_number.value }}</span>
              {% if step.label.value != blank %}
                <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__group-name">{{ step.label.value }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="montibello-pdp-routine__group-cards">
                {% for step_product in step_products %}
                  {% assign card_gallery = step_product.metafields.montibello.official_gallery.value | split: ',' %}
                  {% assign card_file = card_gallery | first | strip %}
                  <a href="{{ step_product.url }}" class="montibello-pdp-routine__ur-card">
                    <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__ur-canvas">
                      {% if card_file != blank %}
                        <img src="{{ card_file | asset_url }}" alt="{{ step_product.title | escape }}" width="1600" height="2239" loading="lazy">
                      {% elsif step_product.featured_image != blank %}
                        {{ step_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: step_product.title }}
                      {% endif %}
                    </span>
                    <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__ur-eyebrow">{{ step_product.metafields.montibello.subfamily.value | default: subfamily | replace: 'Color Last', 'Colour Last' }}</span>
                    <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__ur-title">{{ step_product.title | remove_first: 'HOP ' }}</span>
                  </a>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
        {% for step in steps %}
          {% assign step_products = step.products.value %}
          {% for step_product in step_products %}
            <li class="montibello-pdp-routine__card">
              <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__number">{{ step.step_number.value }}</span>
              <a href="{{ step_product.url }}" class="montibello-pdp-routine__product-link">
                {% if step_product.featured_image != blank %}
                  {{
                    step_product.featured_image
                    | image_url: width: 300
                    | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'montibello-pdp-routine__product-image', widths: '150,220,300'
                  }}
                {% endif %}
                <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__product-title">{{ step_product.title }}</span>
              </a>
              {% if step.label.value != blank %}
                <span class="montibello-pdp-routine__group-label">{{ step.label.value }}</span>
              {% endif %}
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </ol>

      <button
        type="button"
        class="montibello-pdp-routine__arrow montibello-pdp-routine__arrow--next"
        data-montibello-routine-next
        aria-label="Paso siguiente"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% stylesheet %}
  .montibello-pdp-routine__heading {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    padding-inline: 20px;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      padding-inline: 30px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__viewport {
    position: relative;
    /* `width: 100%; min-width: 0`: without an explicit width, this box
       sized to its CONTENT's intrinsic width (992px for 4 cards) instead
       of the section's available width, so `.montibello-pdp-routine__list`
       below never actually had anything to scroll within — the whole wide
       box just overflowed the page (measured 1008px document scrollWidth
       on a 390px viewport, confirmed via bisection to this exact section).
       `min-width: 0` overrides the flex/grid default `min-width: auto`
       that would otherwise still force content-based sizing here. */
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__list {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 4px 20px 12px;
    list-style: none;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-padding-inline: 20px;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      padding-inline: 30px;
      scroll-padding-inline: 30px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__list::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__card {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 62vw;
    max-width: 220px;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      width: 200px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__number {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #2e2d2c;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__product-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__product-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 180px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__product-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__group-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow {
    display: none;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      display: flex;
      position: absolute;
      top: 90px;
      z-index: 1;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e4dfd4);
      background: #fff;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow--prev {
    left: -8px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow--next {
    right: -8px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow:disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* ===== HOP ULTRA REPAIR forensic routine (official, 1440): 1300px slider,
     group slides (244px canvases, 15px gap inside a group, 50px between
     groups with a 1px centred rule), 40px bold step number, 16px/500 label,
     244x341 canvases, 12px eyebrow + 23px/700 title, 50px circular arrows
     overlapping the slider edges. ===== */
  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair {
    font-family: 'TTCommons', 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    color: #000;
    padding-block: 50px !important;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair * {
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__heading {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 40px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__viewport {
    max-width: 1300px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__list {
    gap: 50px;
    padding: 0 20px 20px;
    scroll-padding-inline: 20px;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      padding: 0 0 20px;
      scroll-padding-inline: 0;
    }
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__group {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__group + .montibello-pdp-routine__group::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: -25px;
    width: 1px;
    background: #bdbdbd;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__group-number {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 40px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__group-name {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 19.7px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__group-cards {
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: max-content;
    min-width: 244px;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-canvas {
    display: block;
    width: 244px;
    height: 341px;
    background: #fafafa;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-canvas img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-eyebrow {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-title {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 23px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    top: 231px;
    border: 0;
    background: rgba(120, 120, 120, 0.6);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow--prev {
    left: -20px;
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow--next {
    right: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    /* official mobile: 35/35 left heading, 35px numbers, no step label and
       no eyebrow, 189x264 canvases, 30px between groups */
    .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair {
      padding-block: 30px !important;
      padding-inline: 0 !important;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__heading {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-size: 35px;
      line-height: 35px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__list {
      gap: 30px;
      margin-inline: -16px;
      padding: 0 16px 20px;
      scroll-padding-inline: 16px;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine__group + .montibello-pdp-routine__group::before {
      left: -15px;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine__group-number {
      font-size: 35px;
      line-height: 35px;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine__group-name,
    .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-eyebrow {
      display: none;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-card,
    .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-canvas {
      width: 189px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-canvas {
      height: 264px;
    }

    .montibello-pdp-routine__ur-title {
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 21px;
      white-space: normal;
    }
  }

  .montibello-pdp-routine--hop-ultra-repair .montibello-pdp-routine__arrow:disabled {
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-montibello-routine-track]').forEach((track) => {
      const viewport = track.closest('.montibello-pdp-routine__viewport');
      const prev = viewport.querySelector('[data-montibello-routine-prev]');
      const next = viewport.querySelector('[data-montibello-routine-next]');
      const first = track.firstElementChild;
      const gap = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(track).columnGap) || 24;
      const scrollByCard = () => (first ? first.getBoundingClientRect().width + gap : 220);

      const updateArrows = () => {
        const max = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth - 2;
        prev.disabled = track.scrollLeft <= 2;
        next.disabled = track.scrollLeft >= max;
      };

      prev?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        track.scrollBy({ left: -scrollByCard(), behavior: 'smooth' });
      });
      next?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        track.scrollBy({ left: scrollByCard(), behavior: 'smooth' });
      });
      track.addEventListener('scroll', updateArrows, { passive: true });
      updateArrows();
    });
  });
{% endjavascript %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PDP Rutina",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Título",
      "default": "Descubre la rutina completa"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "Ancho de sección",
      "options": [
        { "value": "page-width", "label": "Ancho de página" },
        { "value": "full-width", "label": "Ancho completo" }
      ],
      "default": "page-width"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Superior",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Inferior",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
